# REQ-06: changes to infrastructure, firewall rules, database access, and the
# pipeline and review rules that enforce them need approval from the platform
# owner. This only blocks merges while the main branch rule has "Require review
# from Code Owners" turned on (see .github/rulesets/main.json).
#
# Later lines take precedence over earlier ones.

/EVotingPlatform/infra/              @avetur-git
/EVotingPlatform/tests/iac/          @avetur-git
/EVotingPlatform/Dockerfile          @avetur-git
/EVotingPlatform/docker-compose.yml  @avetur-git

# The workflows, this file and the ruleset: without this, a PR could weaken
# the checks or remove the owner requirement in the same change.
/.github/                            @avetur-git
